        "While loading, show `Loading deliveries…` in an element with the class `status--loading` and no rows.",
        "On success, show one `.row` per delivery and `6 deliveries` in an element with the class `count`.",
        "For an empty export, show `No deliveries` in an element with the class `empty`.",
        "On failure, show `Could not load the deliveries:` and the reason in an element with the class `status--error`, plus a Retry button with the class `retry` that reloads the source selected now. Show nothing else while the error is up.",
        "A response or an error from an older request must not change the screen once the source has changed again."
      ],
